This independently implemented connector consulted the official Databento Rust
client protocol reference at commit d75ab48a63732d70d6943e319e986c601bf0dc4f.
Reference project: https://github.com/databento/databento-rs (Apache-2.0).
No official client library is linked or invoked at runtime.

The focused Databento Binary Encoding codec, dbn 0.73.0, is a runtime dependency.
Source: https://github.com/databento/dbn
License: Apache-2.0. Its source package includes the applicable license notices.
Committed DBN fixtures are synthetic and generated by examples/generate_fixtures.rs
using that codec. They contain no customer or credentialed market data.
